58
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:41,999
that certain sultanism of his brain which had otherwise in good degree remained unmanifested.

59
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:48,478
Through those forms that same sultanism became incarnate in an irresistible dictatorship.

60
00:04:48,479 --> 00:04:53,999
For be a man's intellectual superiority what it will. It can never assume the

61
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:58,796
practical available supremacy over other men without the aid of some sort of

62
00:04:58,797 --> 00:05:03,918
external arts and entrenchments always in themselves more or less poultry in

63
00:05:03,919 --> 00:05:09,199
base. This it is that forever keeps God's true princes of the empire from

64
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:13,918
the world's hustings, and leaves the highest honors that this heir can give

65
00:05:13,919 --> 00:05:18,636
to those men who become famous more through their infinite inferiority to

66
00:05:18,637 --> 00:05:23,519
the choice hidden handful of the divine inert than through their undoubted

67
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:29,438
superiority over the dead level of the mass. Such large virtue lurks in these

68
00:05:29,439 --> 00:05:35,039
small things, when extreme political superstitions invest them, that in some

69
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:40,717
royal instances, even to idiot imbecelity, they have imparted potency.

70
00:05:40,718 --> 00:05:46,399
But when, as in the case of Nicholas Thesar, the ringed crown of geographical

71
00:05:46,400 --> 00:05:53,278
empire encircles an imperial brain, then the plebeian herds crouch a based before

72
00:05:53,279 --> 00:05:55,679
the tremendous centralization.

73
00:05:55,680 --> 00:06:00,399
Nor will the tragic dramatist who would depict moral indomitableness in its

74
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:05,519
