75
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:09,598
in his art as the one now alluded to.

76
00:06:09,599 --> 00:06:15,519
But Ahab, my captain, still moves before me in all his Nantucket grimness and

77
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:20,557
shaggginess, and in this episode touching emperors and kings, I must not

78
00:06:20,558 --> 00:06:26,158
conceal that I have only to do with a poor old whale hunter like him, and

79
00:06:26,159 --> 00:06:31,999
therefore all outward majestical trappings and housings are denied me. Oh

80
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:37,758
Ahab, what shall be grand in thee, it must needs be plucked at from the skies

81
00:06:37,759 --> 00:06:45,159
and dived for in the deep and featured in the unbodied air.
